corti-transcribe-local — third-party model & runtime attributions
==================================================================

This crate runs pre-trained models through ONNX Runtime/sherpa-onnx and, when selected, through
transcribe.cpp/GGML. Models are downloaded into Corti's cache and are not redistributed in this repository.
Their licenses require the following attributions:

