    https://huggingface.co/nvidia/speakerverification_en_titanet_large
  - WeSpeaker VoxCeleb ResNet34-LM (English). © WeSpeaker authors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
    https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker
